  "solution": "**Given:**\n\ntan θ = 5/12\n\n**Calculation:**\n\ntan θ = 5/12 = p/b\n\np = 5, b = 12\n\nh = √{p² + b²} = √{5² + 12²} = √{25 + 144} = √169 = 13 \n\nSo,\n\n(cos θ + 5cot θ)/(cosec θ - cos θ)\n\n⇒ (12/13 + 5 × 12/5) / (13/5 - 12/13)\n\n⇒ (12/13 + 60/5) / (13/5 - 12/13)\n\n⇒ [(60 + 780)/ 65] / [(169 - 60)/65]\n\n⇒ 840 / 109\n\n**Therefore, the correct answer is option (4).**",
